      "result_description": "Colchester and East Essex CC - 1st XI - Overs Win",
      "result_applied_to": "58739",
      "match_notes": "Rain 14.03. Ilford 101 for 5 at that point. 30 Minutes allowed; plus Tea taken early. 16:15 resumption. 11 Overs lost by both sides on time deduction. Colchester set 149 to win in 39 overs.<br>DLS 1.0 (2014 version) method. It was a (rare) lesser target for Colchester because Ilford had used a disproportionate number of resources (five wickets) before the break. Had Ilford lost only (say) two wickets at the break, the resource equation would have swung in their favour. This DLS position is similar to the outcome of England V Sri Lanka on 3rd December 2014, but is very rare (but correct).",
